{"ID":"20240205153833-nm7ds72","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153833-nm7ds72","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153833-nm7ds72\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091757-29bf3uw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205155905-jvq379r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091757-29bf3uw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:157,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:157\u0026#125;","title":"山豆根","type":"doc","updated":"20240830170138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091757-29bf3uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091757-29bf3uw","updated":"20240206091801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于广西、广东、贵州、云南等地。\n【性状】\t干燥根呈不规则的结节状，顶端常残留茎基或茎痕，其下着生数条根。根为长圆柱形，有时分枝，略弯曲，长102035cm，直径0.3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1cm；表面棕色至黑棕色，有纵皱纹及横长略突起的皮孔。质硬难折断，断面略平坦、浅棕色，并可见环状形成层，中心无髓。气微弱，味极苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有毒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，消肿利咽。用于火毒蕴结，咽喉肿痛，齿龈肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091751-8wflqml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091751-8wflqml","updated":"20240206091751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091751-m8549ed.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155905-jvq379r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155905-jvq379r","updated":"20240205155905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山豆根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山豆根-20240205155905-12ishgk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712151211-k2i6cmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712151211-k2i6cmx","updated":"20240712151822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 409px;","style":"width: 399px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山豆根 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山豆根 5-20240712151543-igpdzrx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 399px;\" parent-style=\"width: 409px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 392px;","style":"width: 382px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山豆根 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山豆根 4-20240712151301-qc7c2iz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 382px;\" parent-style=\"width: 392px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712152020-r1t0nij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712152020-r1t0nij","updated":"20240712152029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 784px;","style":"width: 774px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山豆根 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山豆根 6-20240712152020-9ss6fbu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 774px;\" parent-style=\"width: 784px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Child